    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i've tried the \"small steps\" thing before. it's just a cycle. i open a door and it's just another room in the same house. everything feels so heavy and purposeless. it's like i'm just waiting for something to happen that never will. i'm just so tired of existing in this loop.",
