      "content": "Your pain is real, and while therapy cannot erase a burning house, a skilled clinician can help you build temporary shelter while you heal internally, rather than forcing you to rebuild the destroyed structure. Sometimes stepping away from traditional talk therapy toward expressive arts or community support groups offers a path that doesn't feel like \"fixing\" who you already are. Please know that you are not a fundamental error; you are a human being in severe distress who deserves care that respects the depth of your existing suffering.",
